            "review_title": "Review at Xoi Chi Em",
            "review_text": "Maria_Otaka\nFrance4 contributions\n1\nBest Xoi in Hanoi\nJul 2018 • Business\nBefore coming to Hanoi, I tried to find some place to eat and saw that Xoi Yen on Nguyen Huu Huan str is very famous. I came and tried, but I was so disappointed about their attitude. \nOne day, when I was on the way from the hotel to visit Uncle HO's Mausoleum, I saw this restaurant and decided to try. And...with me, this is the best Xoi. You should come and try. sI love ribs with spicy sauce , \"char siu\" so so much. \nThe price is cheap, could you believe that I paid 2 dollars for lunch?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 7, 2018",
